<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57889" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλήρουχ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῆρος, ἔχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who held an allotment of land</i>, esp. <i>an
				allotment in a foreign country assigned him as a citizen</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.60.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.114.9
			</span></i>; esp. in Ptolemaic Egypt, <i>holder of land by military
				tenure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PCair.Zen.
				3.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				326.37
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.344.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2p.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητέρα πολλῶν ἐτῶν κληροῦχον</span>
			<i>having</i> old age <i>for her lot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				508
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρμῆ . . Φιλιππίδου κληροῦχε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					89
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one who distributed allotments</i> to citizens, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ. θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.121
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>holder of an inheritance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.290
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in Roman
			Egypt, <i>land-owner, landlord,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFay.
				82.19
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				7193r
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				ii 2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. γῆ</span> land
				<i>distributed in allotments</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.75
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
